# Does a three-vessel acid/base/spectator MIX conserve equivalents and predict residual acidity?
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 HCl 0.002mol
new
add v2 water 200mL
add v2 KOH 0.001mol
new
add v3 water 300mL
add v3 NaNO3 0.001mol
new
mix v1 1 v2 1 into v4
new
mix v4 1 v3 1 into v5
measure v5 ph
inspect
